  "description": "ACIBIB crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n n a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H151 Eu9 O54 Ti2. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Ti1 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Eu1B (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu3B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu5B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Ti1B (Ti) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.368-4.149 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.65-140.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C90H151O54Eu9Ti2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 14 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
